{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119178","id":3618593529,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Xr1r5","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119178","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119178.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119178.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119178","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119178/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119178/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119178/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/37b38afb90e2f917251c2a68386e8a067101a0f0","number":119178,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Prioritize 'step' in Range property order","user":{"login":"Kubli-zachary","id":49887158,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODg3MTU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49887158?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kubli-zachary","html_url":"https://github.com/Kubli-zachary","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kubli-zachary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kubli-zachary/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kubli-zachary/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kubli-zachary/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kubli-zachary/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kubli-zachary/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kubli-zachary/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kubli-zachary/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kubli-zachary/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In Range the 'min_value' property uses the 'step' property in it's calculation for snapping 'value'. Setting 'step' after 'min_value' causes unexpected behavior. This PR aims to make the editor work with this order in mind.\r\n\r\nFor example this fixes issue #119137 where the users tries to assign a fractional negative \"min_value\" and leave \"value\" at zero. Since the Range assumes that the \"step\" is 1 while assigning \"min_value\", it will snap \"value\" to the nearest integer offset from 'min_value'. In the case of this issue min_value is -0.2, it maps 'value' from 0 to -0.2, even though the user also sets 'step' to 0 .0001 which would include 0 as a valid snapping target, but 'value' has already been snapped to -0.2, before step is assigned.\r\n\r\nThis stale snapping occurs when launching or saving the project.. reordering step ahead of min_value fixes both of these.\r\n\r\nThis seems to be the same issue described in #89252","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undete